NOTE C.5 [written] K_F := cone(<F, cnot> . products) is closed (finite union of compact images, conv-hull of a compact set), convex, admissible, <F, cnot>-invariant, inside Q3; a pure state of K_F is extreme in Q3, hence a group image of a pure product; psi psi^dag is not one (C.2), so K_F != Q3 and K_F != R_B Q3 (R_B Q3 is not inside Q3). Hence IE1 restricted to a finite subgroup fails even for closed cones.
