VERDICT IE1-REGIMES: driveWords3 = SO(3) (uncountable; IE1 over it is full IE1); countable dense local families need a closed cone (otherwise only int Q3 <= K <= Q3); finite local families fail even for closed cones (Clifford orbit and the native group H)
